'''Gruthkul's Despair''' is a [[debuff]] applied by [[Gruthkul, Mother of Despair]] and [[Erebix, Light's Bane]], its map variant. The debuff reduces [[light radius]], increases all [[damage taken]] by 5%, and reduces [[action speed]] by 2%.<ref name="Prohibited Library Debuff"/> It stacks up to 9 times, once for each 10% life lost by the boss. It is continuously applied while inside the boss arena. 

==Trivia==
The file name of the debuff icon of '''Gruthkul's Despair''', is "Despair.dds" under the folder "BuffIcons", while the skill icon of {{il|Despair}} is also named "Despair.dds" under the folder "SkillIcons". 

